⚡️XMP – Enabled (Профиль 1);
⚡️Hyper-Threading – Disabled (если ядер много);
⚡️Intel Virtualization Technology (VT-x) – Enabled;
⚡️VT-d – Enabled;
⚡️ASPM – Disabled;
⚡️Intel C-State – Disabled;
⚡️Enhanced Halt State (C1E) – Disabled;
⚡️Hardware Prefetcher – Enabled;
⚡️Energy Efficient Turbo – Disabled;
⚡️Spread Spectrum – Disabled;
⚡️Fast Boot – Disabled.

Для AMD:
⚡️EXPO – Enabled (Профиль 1);
⚡️SMT Mode – Auto или Enabled;
